    \ (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 138 details sent to your System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 169 | 1 | Synergy Test: Dilated CNN (d=4) + Increased CNN Capacity | Nomos I | 94 | 47.70 |\n| 148 | 1 | Synergy Test: Dilated CNN (d=4) + Double-Step Recurrence | Nomos I | 83 | 71.00 |\n| 138 | 1 | Final Experiment: Dilated CNN with Dilation=4 | Nomos I | 79 | 73.80 |\n| 134 | 1 | Dilated CNN with Dilation=3 | Nomos I | 77 | 67.50 |\n| 128 | 1 | New Direction: Dilated CNN on SOTA Baseline | Nomos I | 75 | 68.90 |\n| 123 | 1 | Ablation: Feature Engineering\
