    **Conclusion & Fix:**

    These repeated failures are unacceptable and highlight a weakness in my development process. I must be more rigorous. The fix is to correctly shape the input to the convolution to be 4D (`NHWC`). I will correct this and resubmit. The scientific hypothesis remains valid and untested.



