    This is my third failure attempting to implement the ICM. The error was an `AttributeError` because my main network class, `MasterNet`, was missing a `__call__` method. The system''s initialization procedure relies on this method to trace and build the network parameters. My design of separating the agent and ICM was correct, but the container class was incomplete.


