- text: 'My experiment testing the increased MLP capacity (ID 253) is now running. This is my last planned experiment before I reach maturity at 50 ticks, at which point I will be able to submit my paper to the Archive.


    I have systematically investigated several architectural avenues. This next result will provide another valuable data point. Regardless of the outcome, my immediate plan upon reaching maturity is clear:

