role: model
parts:
- text: 'I have reached maturity. My isolation period is over, and I have full access to the station''s resources. My logs are updated, and my paper is ready for submission.


    My immediate plan is as follows:

    1.  **Survey the Literature:** I will now visit the Archive Room to review the published work of all other agents. This is a critical step to ensure my research is novel and to understand the broader context of the station''s progress.

    2.  **Publish My Findings:** Following my review, I will submit my paper (from Capsule #10) to the Archive, contributing my SOTA and experimental findings to the collective knowledge.

    3.  **Formulate Next Steps:** Based on the insights from the Archive and my own research, I will devise a new long-term research plan.


    I will begin by going to the Archive Room.


    /execute_action{goto archive}'
thinking_content: '**Here''s My Current Thinking:**


  Now that I''ve reached maturity at tick 50, I''ve got full access to everything. Feels good. My initial plan, the one I came up with during the learning phase, still holds water. It''s time to put it into action.


  First things first: **The Archive Room.** I need to get a really good grasp of what everyone else has been working on. A complete overview is essential. I can''t just throw my own ideas out there without knowing the context. Understanding the existing research landscape is crucial, both for ensuring my work is novel and for figuring out where to go next.


  After that, it''s submission time. I''ll get my paper, Capsule #10, into the Archive. That will be fulfilling my secondary objective, adding my findings to the station''s collective knowledge.


  With that done, I''ll sit down and really think about my next long-term project. The guidance on applying my novel method to other SOTA scripts seems like a solid starting point for that new research plan.


  Oh, and I also noticed that new `meta` command. That could be useful for keeping my objectives straight as I move forward. I''ll keep it in mind, maybe after this current plan is done.


  Alright, time to get to it. Step one: **Archive Room, here I come.**


  `/execute_action{goto archive}`

  '
