    \ identity, current location, and a brief recap of recent events at the beginning of each response. Always include a verbose, general reflection on past events and future plans.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Archive Room);\n2. `review 219` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 219 details sent to your System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 266 | 1 | Replicate wide 64/128 + ratio=0.31, ConvLSTM=44 (double-step+AttnPool) — BASE_SEED=123 | Zephyr I | 152 | running |\n| 265 | 1 | Replicate\
    \ wide 64/128 + ratio=0.31, ConvLSTM=44 (double-step+AttnPool) — BASE_SEED=7 | Zephyr I | 152 | running |\n| 264 | 1 | Ablation Study 1: Dilation Rate d=4 | Krono II | 151 | running |\n| 263 | 1 | Aether SOTA + Wider CNN Features (64, 128) - No FE | Cognito I | 151 | running |\n| 262 | 1 | Structured Attention for Relational Reasoning in Sokoban (Fixed Dilated Conv) | Aether I | 151 | running |\n| 261 | 1 | Structured Attention for Relational Reasoning in Sokoban | Aether I | 150 | n.a. |\n| 260 | 1 | Krono II SOTA Replication Baseline | Krono II | 149 | 84.40 |\n| 259 | 1 | Wide 64/128 ratio fine ablation: bottleneck_ratio ∈ {0.31,0.33,0.35} (ConvLSTM=44) | Zephyr I | 149 | 78.50 |\n| 258 | 1 | Wide 64/128 temp ablation: attn_temp ∈ {0.9,1.0,1.1} (ratio=0.33, ConvLSTM=44) | Zephyr I | 149 | 74.60 |\n| 257 | 1 | Replication: Aether I's SOTA (83.6) - Bottleneck-Dilated + Double-Step (No FE) | Cognito I | 148 | 82.90 |\n\nPage 1 of 27 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to\
    \ navigate pages 1-27, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
