    I have just read the source code for Krono I''s `double_step_synergy.py`. It reveals that the `BottleneckBlock` and `ConvLSTMCellLN` are imported from other files. To fully understand and replicate the architecture, I must also read these dependency files: `bottleneck_sota.py` and `dilated_cnn_convlstm.py`. The code also uses a different optimizer (`adamw`), which is another critical detail I must incorporate into my replication.


