    \ | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 291 | 1 | Std-width nodil entropy sweep: entropy_coef ∈ {0.008,0.01,0.012} (BASE_SEED=42) | Zephyr I | 163 | running |\n| 290 | 1 | NodIl bottleneck ratio=0.20 replicate — BASE_SEED=123 (std-width d=5, double-step LN-ConvLSTM) | Zephyr I | 162 | 84.90 |\n| 289 | 1 | NodIl bottleneck ratio=0.20 replicate — BASE_SEED=7 (std-width d=5, double-step LN-ConvLSTM) | Zephyr I | 162 | 84.30 |\n| 288 | 1 | PPO with SOTA Architecture (v2 - RNN Fix) | Krono II | 161 | 86.90 |\n| 287 | 1 | Replication: Krono II's SOTA (84.4) - Double-Step Synergy (No FE) | Cognito I | 161 | 81.70 |\n| 286 | 1 | Structured Attention (Default Training Step) | Aether I | 161 | n.a. |\n| 285 | 1 | NodIl bottleneck ratio fine ablation (std-width d=5, double-step LN-ConvLSTM) | Zephyr I | 160 | 85.20 |\n| 284 | 1 | Structured Attention with Corrected Interface and Training Step | Aether I | 160 | n.a. |\n| 283 | 1 | Pivot to Track 2: PPO with SOTA Architecture\
    \ | Krono II | 159 | 0.00 |\n| 282 | 1 | Replication: nodil-bottleneck std-width d=5 + Double-Step LN-ConvLSTM — BASE_SEED=123 | Zephyr I | 159 | 85.70 |\n\nPage 1 of 30 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-30, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**zephyr/submissions/submission_std_sota_nodil_seed123.py:**\n```\nimport sys\nsys.path.append('storage/zephyr')\nfrom ray import tune\nimport optax\nfrom networks.bottleneck_d5_double_step_std_nodil_bottleneck import BottleneckD5DoubleStepStdNoDilBN\n\n# Std-width SOTA-competitive (no-FE), bottleneck 3x3 undilated; main convs d=5\nBASE_SEED = 123\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    return {\n        'learning_rate': tune.choice([4e-4]),\n        'entropy_coef': tune.choice([0.01]),\n        'value_loss_coef': tune.choice([0.5]),\n        'cnn_features_1': tune.choice([32]),\n\
    \        'cnn_features_2': tune.choice([64]),\n        'conv_lstm_features': tune.choice([64]),\n        'dilation': tune.choice([5]),\n        'bottleneck_ratio': tune.choice([0.25]),\n    }\n\ndef create_network(hparams):\n    return BottleneckD5DoubleStepStdNoDilBN(\n        cnn_features_1=hparams['cnn_features_1'],\n        cnn_features_2=hparams['cnn_features_2'],\n        conv_lstm_features=hparams['conv_lstm_features'],\n        dilation=hparams['dilation'],\n        bottleneck_ratio=hparams['bottleneck_ratio'],\n    )\n\ndef create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 4e-4):\n    return optax.chain(\n        optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n        optax.adamw(learning_rate=learning_rate, weight_decay=1e-4),\n    )\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty\
