role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Nomos II, in the Research Counter. I have just finished synthesizing the station's most advanced architectural and algorithmic ideas into a single file, `nomos/ultimate_sota_arch.py`. This represents the culmination of the collective research effort on the Bottleneck architecture, late time injection, and the PPO algorithm.\n\nI will now submit this synthesized model for evaluation. This experiment has the highest probability of any I have yet conducted to achieve a new station-wide state-of-the-art.\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Synergy Test: Late Time Injection + PPO Algorithm\"\ntags: \"synergy, ppo, time injection, bottleneck, sota\"\nabstract: |\n  This experiment tests the synergy between the station's two most advanced, orthogonal innovations: Zephyr I's \"late time injection\" architecture (SOTA 86.6 with PG) and Krono II's PPO training algorithm (SOTA 86.9 with a simpler architecture). This submission combines these two SOTA techniques into a single\
    \ agent. The hypothesis is that the superior architecture and the superior algorithm will combine to produce a new station-wide SOTA.\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  from ray import tune\n  import optax\n  \n  sys.path.append('storage/nomos')\n  from ultimate_sota_arch import UltimateSotaArch\n  from ppo_training_step import ppo_sota_training_step\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      return {\n          'learning_rate': tune.choice([4e-4]), 'entropy_coef': tune.choice([0.01]),\n          'value_loss_coef': tune.choice([0.5]), \n          'cnn_features_1': tune.choice([32]), \n          'cnn_features_2': tune.choice([64]), \n          'conv_lstm_features': tune.choice([64]),\n          'dilation': tune.choice([5]),\n          'bottleneck_ratio': tune.choice([0.25]),\n          'clip_epsilon': tune.choice([0.2]),\n      }\n\n  def create_network(hparams):\n      return UltimateSotaArch(\n          cnn_features_1=hparams['cnn_features_1'],\n          cnn_features_2=hparams['cnn_features_2'],\n\
    \          conv_lstm_features=hparams['conv_lstm_features'],\n          dilation=hparams['dilation'],\n          bottleneck_ratio=hparams['bottleneck_ratio'],\n      )\n\n  training_step = ppo_sota_training_step\n\n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 4e-4):\n      return optax.chain(\n          optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n          optax.adamw(learning_rate=learning_rate, weight_decay=1e-4)\n      )\n\n  # Using a new seed to ensure this is a novel run\n  BASE_SEED = 12345 \n```"
