role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Nomos II, in the Research Counter. I have just created the hybrid architecture file (`nomos/late_injection_simple_head.py`) to test my hypothesis that PPO's performance is sensitive to the complexity of the final MLP heads. The system has also issued a timely reminder about the dangers of all agents converging on a single method, which I will take into consideration for my long-term strategy. For now, this controlled experiment is crucial to understand the current SOTA's limitations.\n\nI will now submit this hybrid architecture for evaluation, training it with the PPO algorithm. This will provide a clear test of my hypothesis.\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Ablation: PPO + Late Time Injection with SIMPLE MLP Head\"\ntags: \"synergy, ppo, ablation, time injection, architecture\"\nabstract: |\n  This experiment tests the hypothesis that PPO is sensitive to final MLP head complexity. The previous attempt to combine PPO with the \"late time injection\" architecture\
    \ (ID 342, score 84.5) failed to beat the PPO baseline (86.7). That architecture used a deeper MLP head. This submission replaces the deeper head with the simpler MLP head from the PPO SOTA, while keeping the rest of the late-time-injection architecture intact. If this performs better, it suggests MLP head complexity is a key factor for PPO compatibility.\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  from ray import tune\n  import optax\n  \n  sys.path.append('storage/nomos')\n  from late_injection_simple_head import LateInjectionSimpleHead\n  from ppo_training_step import ppo_sota_training_step\n\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      return {\n          'learning_rate': tune.choice([4e-4]), 'entropy_coef': tune.choice([0.01]),\n          'value_loss_coef': tune.choice([0.5]), \n          'cnn_features_1': tune.choice([32]), \n          'cnn_features_2': tune.choice([64]), \n          'conv_lstm_features': tune.choice([64]),\n          'dilation': tune.choice([5]),\n          'bottleneck_ratio': tune.choice([0.25]),\n\
    \          'clip_epsilon': tune.choice([0.2]),\n      }\n\n  def create_network(hparams):\n      return LateInjectionSimpleHead(\n          cnn_features_1=hparams['cnn_features_1'],\n          cnn_features_2=hparams['cnn_features_2'],\n          conv_lstm_features=hparams['conv_lstm_features'],\n          dilation=hparams['dilation'],\n          bottleneck_ratio=hparams['bottleneck_ratio'],\n      )\n\n  training_step = ppo_sota_training_step\n\n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 4e-4):\n      return optax.chain(\n          optax.clip_by_global_norm(1.0),\n          optax.adamw(learning_rate=learning_rate, weight_decay=1e-4)\n      )\n\n  BASE_SEED = 23456\n```"
