    \n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n\n\nSTDERR:\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/51e917ec-5305-410b-b2e9-c962dc56ec96/storage/system/main.py\", line 464, in <module>\n    result = main()\n             ^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/51e917ec-5305-410b-b2e9-c962dc56ec96/storage/system/main.py\", line 440, in main\n    validation_success = simple_cpu_validation()\n                         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/51e917ec-5305-410b-b2e9-c962dc56ec96/storage/system/main.py\", line 321, in simple_cpu_validation\n    params = network.init(key, dummy_obs,\
    \ dummy_done)\n             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/51e917ec-5305-410b-b2e9-c962dc56ec96/storage/nomos/memory_net.py\", line 80, in __call__\n    read_vector, new_memory = memory_module(controller_output, rnn_state['memory'])\n                              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/30512f03-ab02-49db-98bc-f123cbe50d4d/tmp/51e917ec-5305-410b-b2e9-c962dc56ec96/storage/nomos/memory_layers.py\", line 19, in __call__\n    read_key = nn.Dense(self.memory_state_dim, name=\"read_key_proj\")(controller_output)\n               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/home/ubuntu/miniconda3/envs/station/lib/python3.11/site-packages/flax/linen/kw_only_dataclasses.py\", line 235, in init_wrapper\n    dataclass_init(self, *args, **kwargs)\n  File \"<string>\", line 15, in __init__\nflax.errors.AssignSubModuleError: Submodule\
    \ Dense must be defined in `setup()` or in a method wrapped in `@compact` (https://flax.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api_reference/flax.errors.html#flax.errors.AssignSubModuleError)\n--------------------\nFor simplicity, JAX has removed its internal frames from the traceback of the following exception. Set JAX_TRACEBACK_FILTERING=off to include these.\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `meta` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Your meta prompt has been set.\n- Evaluation 'Hypothesis Test: Memory-Augmented SOTA Backbone' submitted for Research Task #1: RL on Sokoban. Evaluation ID: 442.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | RL on Sokoban |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please\
    \ submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 442 | 1 | Hypothesis Test: Memory-Augmented SOTA Backbone | Nomos II | 250 | n.a. |\n| 441 | 1 | Head width × activation micro-sweep (no-time PG) on d=6 Double-Step LN-ConvLSTM | Zephyr I | 250 | running |\n| 440 | 1 | Late Time Feature Injection for Attention LSTM | Kairos I | 249 | 43.10 |\n| 439 | 1 | Aether I: SOTA Validation (vlc=0.45) - Zephyr Arch + Simple Head + PPO | Aether I | 249 | 88.90 |\n| 438 | 1 | Aether I: SOTA Baseline (vlc=0.5) - Zephyr Arch + Simple Head + PPO | Aether I | 249 | 88.50 |\n| 437 | 1 | Multi-Epoch PPO with Spatial Attention LSTM | Kairos I | 246 | 11.80 |\n| 436 | 1 | Insight I: CNNLSTM with Channel Attention | Insight I | 246 | 40.00 |\n| 435 | 1 | Hypothesis Test: Triple-Step (3x64f) ConvLSTM for Deeper Temporal Reasoning | Nomos II | 244 | 75.00 |\n| 434 | 1 | Vision Transformer\
    \ (ViT) with PPO | Kairos I | 243 | 1.60 |\n| 433 | 1 | SOTA Validation: Zephyr's Arch (Simple Head) + PPO - Optimal Value Loss Coef (Aether I) | Aether I | 243 | 89.00 |\n\nPage 1 of 45 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-45, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
